              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pantu mu nshiku shine shilya, kabili pa nshita ine ilya, elyo nkabwesesha abena Yuda na bena Yerusalemu ishuko lyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili elintu nkalonganika imishobo ya benafyalo yonse, no kubaleta mwishika lya Yehoshafati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yehoshafati,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yehoshafati mu Cihibulu ekutila, Yawe aputula umulandu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Emo nkabalubulwisha bonse pali fyonse ifyo bacita ku bantu bandi abena Israeli ababa icikwatwa candi. Pantu ebabasalanganishishe mu fyalo fimbi ifya benafyalo, basha bayakana ne calo candi ica Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi ine imishobo eyalependula pakwakana bantu bandi. Yaleshitisha abalumendo pakuti ikwatilepo bacilende, kabili yaleshitisha abakashana pakuti inwenepo umwangashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
